---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "机场知识库 | 深度科普与选购指南";
const description = "机场狗知识库，为你提供最专业的科学上网、翻墙机场原理、VPN区别及防封锁指南。";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="page-shell home-section" style="padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 80px; min-height: 70vh;">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">新手小白必读</p>
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink);">机场知识库</h1>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-top: 16px; font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 600px;">
        深入浅出的翻墙知识科普，帮你彻底搞懂底层原理，不再花冤枉钱。
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="articles-grid">
      <a href="/knowledge/what-is-jichang-vs-vpn/" class="article-card">
        <div class="card-tag">硬核科普</div>
        <h3>什么是翻墙机场？机场与传统VPN有什么区别？</h3>
        <p>简单来说，传统 VPN 是为全局加密通信设计的通用隐私工具，而“机场”是专门针对 GFW 深度包检测、基于代理协议和专线优化的中国特色科学上网工具...</p>
        <span class="read-more">阅读全文 <span>→</span></span>
      </a>
      
      <!-- Placeholder for future articles -->
      <div class="article-card placeholder">
        <div class="card-tag" style="background: #f3f4f6; color: #9ca3af;">持续更新中</div>
        <h3 style="color: #9ca3af;">更多进阶翻墙教程与避坑指南</h3>
        <p style="color: #d1d5db;">我们正在快马加鞭地为您整理更多高质量的知识科普文章，敬请期待...</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .articles-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .article-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .article-card:not(.placeholder):hover {
      border-color: rgba(36, 87, 230, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(36, 87, 230, 0.08);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }
    .card-tag {
      align-self: flex-start;
      background: #eff4ff;
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .article-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .article-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .read-more {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--blue);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .read-more span {
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .article-card:hover .read-more span {
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }
    .placeholder {
      background: #fcfcfc;
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      cursor: default;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
